{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-work-wp-portfolio-slug-jsx","path":"/work/mariana-mazzucato/","result":{"data":{"wpPortfolio":{"title":"Mariana Mazzucato","content":"<p>In early 2021, I led development for the exciting new redevelopment of a website for Mariana Mazzucato, the world-leading economist. This was a huge project which involved a complex CMS, a massive migration of content from the previous incarnation and exceptional attention to detail on the design of the website. In addition, the client was keen to improve both security and performance of the site, hence the site was designed as a headless WordPress website using GatsbyJS, WPGraphQL and hosted on Netlify.</p>\n","slug":"mariana-mazzucato","url":{"url":"https://marianamazzucato.com/"},"image1":{"image1":{"mediaDetails":{"sizes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/mm1-300x225.png","width":"300","name":"medium"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/mm1-1024x769.png","width":"1024","name":"large"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/mm1-150x150.png","width":"150","name":"thumbnail"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/mm1-768x577.png","width":"768","name":"medium_large"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/mm1-1200x902.png","width":"1200","name":"post-thumbnail"}]}}},"image2":{"image2":{"mediaDetails":{"sizes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/mm2-300x225.png","width":"300","name":"medium"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/mm2-1024x769.png","width":"1024","name":"large"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/mm2-150x150.png","width":"150","name":"thumbnail"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/